#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "The party rocker party rocks!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's not dancing with as much energy, and they seem to be "
"stopping often to cough and catch their breath."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's grown painful mushroom stalks out of their body, "
"writhing in pain as their last neurons still instruct them to dance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a drink in hand."
msgstr ""

