"Crystals, meditation, astral projection, remote viewing, channeling, ESP; "
"it's all real, man.  It all works if you believe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
msgid ""
"&Through all your struggles, you have won the day against the unknown.  Do "
"you wish to struggle more, or rest in your triumph."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
msgid "I wish to rest in my triumph, and let the struggle end."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
msgid ""
"I will continue on and face oblivion, even if it costs me my life and limb."
msgstr ""

