#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The great eaters have returned, along with the false ones.  We must feed the "
"eaters and destroy the pretenders, child."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid ""
"The great eaters are the ones that were lost, what we call dinosaurs, whose "
"meat we took and who are taking it back.  The pretenders are those others "
"that have come to steal the meat of this world.  It does not belong to them "
"and we will take it from their mouths."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
